## Notes
- "Shadow Orphans" (isDeleted=true but still in Firestore) were the cause of "Context Gaslighting".
- "Gap Messages" (in UI but missing in Typesense) were caused by failed indexing or soft-deletions on re-render.
- **HUD Added**: Live readout of `UI | DB | RAG` counts.
- **xAI Embeddings**: Now using native xAI embedding model (768 dims).
- **Atomic Save**: Vectors are now stored inside the Firestore document, preventing sync drift.
- **Fail-Safe**: Chat continues even if Neural API temporarily fails; "Heal" button fixes gaps later.
